OL,3,GNEWSAFrankie the Tiger wins World
OL,4,AConker Championships
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrankie the Tiger has been crowned the
OL,7,Fwinner of this year's World Conker
OL,8,FChampionships.
OL,10,FMore than 250 conker combatants,
OL,11,Fincluding entrants from Japan, Holland
OL,12,Fand Germany, headed to Southwick in
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire for Sunday's event.
OL,15,FFrankie the Tiger, aka Frankie Hooper,
OL,16,F28, from Oundle, clinched the overall
OL,17,Ftitle after beating the men's winner,
OL,18,FSimon Griffiths, in a nail-biting,
OL,19,Fnut-shattering showdown.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
