OL,3,GNEWSAFrankie the Tiger wins World
OL,4,AConker Championships
OL,5,
OL,6,FHooper, who did battle in a tiger
OL,7,Fcostume, said: "I am feeling pretty
OL,8,Fecstatic... I came into it this morning
OL,9,Ffor a chilled fun day with my friends,
OL,10,Fand now I am a world champion for the
OL,11,Ffemales, it is amazing."
